# Agent task routing

**Prerequisite:** `.cursor/rules/00-routing-kernel.mdc` + `docs/agents-routing.md` already applied for this task.

Full ops playbook: `docs/agents-playbook.md`. Profile: `AGENTS.md`. Domain contract: `docs/agents-master.md`.

## Search & indexing

- GSC → `ryndenko1982@gmail.com` (sole Verified Owner) — do not move GSC to mail.ru.
- Bing → `snaiper1984@mail.ru` — `npm run bing:edge` then `bing:index-all` / `bing:setup`.
- IndexNow: `npm run seo:indexnow` (apex + www, all sitemap URLs).
- After HTML deploy: `deploy:full` or at least `seo:indexnow` + `cf:purge-cache`.

## Site audit

- Local links: `npm run check:links`.
- Live sitemap crawl: `npm run check:live-crawl`.
- Config/SEO files: `npm run check:project`.
- AI routing integrity: `npm run check:agents-routing`.

## Skills (after module detection)

- UI → hundesalon-frontend
- SEO/hreflang → hundesalon-seo-multilingual
- Cloudflare → hundesalon-cloudflare + cloudflare-deploy
- Architecture / code links → graphify (`graphify query|path|explain`, `.agents/skills/graphify/`)
- Minimal diff → ponytail (`.cursor/rules/ponytail.mdc`, skills `ponytail*`)
- Session context → RooFlow Memory Bank (`memory-bank/`, UMB)

